@startuml
title CON-SD-D04 Continuity Activation and Scope-Control Flow
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Supervisor / approved authority" as Sup
participant "Operator Console /\napproved governance" as OC
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Continuity Terminal" as CT
participant "Audit / Reconciliation" as Audit

Sup -> OC : request / approve activation
OC -> Central : submit activation scope
Central -> Central : validate Site/Site Group,\ndependency, incident, allowed workflows
alt valid activation
  Central -> Audit : record incident/audit/reconciliation tags
  Central --> CT : enable restricted mode for approved scope
  Central --> OC : degraded-active status
else missing or unsafe scope
  Central --> OC : activation blocked
end
OC -> Central : deactivation / restoration review
Central --> CT : disable continuity-only workflows
Central -> Audit : post-restoration review handoff

note bottom
Activation is explicit, scoped, approved where required, tagged, and reversible.
No automatic fallback.
end note
@enduml
